    "name": "Move Inventory",
    "description": "Use this screen to change the \"location\" of an inventory record.\n\nScan or enter the location barcode or shortened name (code), then scan or enter your inventory barcode or serial number. The form will auto-submit after the inventory is scanned.\n\nFuture Feature Ideas:\n\n- **Undo Last Transaction** - An undo button allows you to \"unmove\" inventory that you already submitted a move for. Use this if you scanned or entered the wrong barcode or serial number by accident.\n- **Inventory Info Card** - Show 1 or more cards listing basic info about the inventory that was just scanned so workers can confirm at a glance that they've scanned the right part.",
